  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759123,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100 Bullets - PlayStation 2\n\nStep into the gritty world of Brian Azzarello’s acclaimed comic series with *100 Bullets*, an action-packed shooter originally planned for the PlayStation 2. Take on the roles of Cole Burns, a familiar face from the comic, and the newly created character, Snow Falls, as you navigate a shadowy landscape of revenge and retribution.\n\nThe game’s original story revolves around Agent Graves, who provides his clients with a briefcase containing the tools for ultimate payback. Experience a unique gameplay system that encourages strategic thinking – \"think before you shoot\" – with an auto-aim system rewarding patience and a \"rage meter\" unleashing devastating power. Utilize enemies as human shields and master a diverse arsenal, including pistols, shotguns, and grenade launchers. \n\nOriginally slated for release in October 2004, this adaptation promised to capture the comic’s distinctive style and moral complexity. While ultimately cancelled due to Acclaim Entertainment’s financial difficulties, the game garnered positive attention for its innovative mechanics and faithfulness to the source material."
    },
